From 991074e7fca9eddd33c61d72767c3729f573dc3e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: xvhaocheng <xvhaocheng@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 14:52:05 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 27/27] Connect banked P/N research modes and bind the complete
 IOMMU research source

Source-organization: 2026-10-17; new commit authored at actual current time.
Feature-ID: CVA6-BANKED-PN-WIRING
Original-source: frozen original working source
Validation scope: source/patch identity only; no build, simulation or experiment.
Atomic ABI binding to child P2: mode1 banked S, mode2 N, mode3 quiet-gated S/N/P/PN; DMA0/1 512-beat buffers, full-copy permission, MSI_BT_ONLY, counters and guarded configuration. Legacy default mode remains 0, which does not make this tree stock.
